research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_NUTS.title=Nuts
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_NUTS.stage.1=Breaking leaves has revealed a surprising source of essentia: nuts. Closer examination shows that they contain traces of Risunium essentia. I must study this new aspect and see what secrets it holds.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_VIS_CRYSTAL_RISUNIUM.title=Crystallized Risunium
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_VIS_CRYSTAL_RISUNIUM.stage.1=Risunium does not appear to be composed of any other aspects I have encountered. I therefore conclude that it must be a primal aspect. Though I have yet to discover naturally occurring Risunium vis crystals, the essentia concentrated within nuts should respond to the same alchemical process used to create other essentia crystals.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_VIS_CRYSTAL_RISUNIUM.stage.2=My experiment was a success. By using quartz shards as a growth medium, I can crystallize Risunium essentia into Risunium vis crystals.<BR>My search for naturally occurring Risunium crystals continues.<BR><BR>I have also discovered a most curious property: Risunium vis crystals resonate with every primal aspect. Unlike ordinary vis crystals, they can occupy any of the six crystal slots around an arcane workbench.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_CRYSTAL_RISUNIUM.title=Cultivating Risunium
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_CRYSTAL_RISUNIUM.stage.1=Despite continued searching, I have found no Risunium crystal clusters growing naturally. Nuts remain my only source of Risunium essentia, but harvesting leaves can only provide so much. I must find a way to grow my own supply.
research.SQUIRREL_WITCHERY_CRYSTAL_RISUNIUM.stage.2=I have found a way to reinvigorate Risunium vis crystals so that I can replant them, much like the crystals of the six familiar primal aspects. Since Risunium crystal clusters do not appear to grow naturally, arcane infusion will have to provide the missing impetus.